WEBVTT

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:15.360
What’s that?

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:20.910
Everything in LINK VRAINS is being 
turned into data and absorbed.

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:22.200
Kusanagi.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:24.970
I have Ghost Girl's data.

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:28.210
I'll analyze it.

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:35.240
What's that weird thing?

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:39.720
What’s happening?

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:45.800
What’s going on?

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:47.750
No good!  We lost control!

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:52.160
Someone explain what's going on!

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:56.640
By analyzing the program's pattern, we know 
this is the work of the Knights of Hanoi!

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:59.050
I know that!

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:02.140
Do something or you’re all fired!

00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:05.280
They completely took over LINK VRAINS!

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:11.280
SOL Technologies created LINK VRAINS.

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:16.260
But the Hanoi, a lame hacker 
group, is controlling it?

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:19.940
There's no way I'll be promoted anymore.

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:25.260
But there must be a way I 
can work this in my favor...

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:27.740
Think...  Think!

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:36.760
How about in other places?

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:40.150
They’re vanishing, just like Ghost Girl.

00:01:40.150 --> 00:01:43.150
Yeah.  Not just buildings and roads.

00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:46.120
Even avatars are turning 
into data and absorbed.

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:48.580
What’s going on?

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:52.890
What will happen to them?

00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:54.820
Everyone, stop watching!

00:01:58.060 --> 00:01:59.110
What?

00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:02.770
They can’t log out?

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:06.450
LINK VRAINS is going to be destroyed!

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:10.980
Yeah.  This is Revolver's game.

00:02:30.570 --> 00:02:33.700
I run Across the universe

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:36.870
At the speed of light

00:02:37.270 --> 00:02:38.740
Begin Loading

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:42.480
Open the door of dreams

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:46.050
VRAINS spreads

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:49.150
Believe in myself

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:52.690
VRAINS continues

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:58.000
The circuit draws the future

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:02.070
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:03:02.430 --> 00:03:03.670
Access!

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:06.370
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:07.970
I'm now With the Wind

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:10.270
Link with my soul

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:13.040
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:14.780
Now Win the Race

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:17.620
Connected world

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:21.120
No matter when

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:24.490
Nothing is impossible

00:03:24.690 --> 00:03:28.630
Strive for hope

00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:33.210
And ride the wind!

00:03:53.950 --> 00:03:55.680
Next on the news...

00:03:55.680 --> 00:04:00.400
SOL Technologies, manager of 
the VR space LINK VRAINS...

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:05.480
...held an emergency press conference 
to announce the shutdown of LINK VRAINS.

00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:10.130
Is Another incident happening again?

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:12.340
Hmm, hard to tell.

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:20.440
SOL Technologies announced a shutdown, but 
people can still log into LINK VRAINS.

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:25.340
Rumors say that they’ve lost control.

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:27.930
That's a concern.

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:31.830
We'll report any further 
details as we receive them.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:33.410
In other news…

00:04:33.420 --> 00:04:36.120
Other news already?

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:39.800
When LINK VRAINS has 
turned into a ghost town?

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:41.800
What's on the other channels?

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:43.370
This morning at Den City Zoo...

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:47.420
Fluff on this channel too?

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:49.370
Oh!  But if I go there...

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:53.600
Scary!

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:57.020
I shouldn’t go to LINK VRAINS for a while.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:02.750
This isn’t the time for a future 
dueling prospect to appear.

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:07.730
I'll be LINK VRAINS’s newest hero 
after this generation is over.

00:05:07.730 --> 00:05:10.690
So I’ll just wait and watch.

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:13.150
Analysis finished!

00:05:13.150 --> 00:05:16.340
This is the data Ghost Girl gave you.

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:20.590
What’s that?

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:22.140
Revolver said…

00:05:22.540 --> 00:05:25.270
The Tower of Hanoi has already activated.

00:05:25.270 --> 00:05:31.120
If you want to stop this game, 
you must defeat me, Playmaker.

00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:33.570
Tower of Hanoi?

00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:35.390
This is Hanoi's game?

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:40.470
Legend says that when Hanoi's game 
ends, the world will be destroyed.

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:42.660
He's starting that game.

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:45.660
Those rings substitute for discs.

00:05:45.660 --> 00:05:51.160
The central pillar extends from 
the underground erasing system.

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:54.720
The top is connected to 
the LINK VRAINS network.

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:58.570
The pillar's lighted portion 
is the erasing system's core.

00:05:58.570 --> 00:06:01.120
Why did he connect that?

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:06.380
Since appearing in LINK VRAINS, this core 
has continued to absorb the surrounding data.

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:08.650
That’s a huge amount!

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:11.260
Yeah.  An incredible amount of data.

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:14.870
But its absorption speed hasn’t decreased.

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:16.560
Unbelievable!

00:06:16.920 --> 00:06:22.260
Revolver built this using the 
underground erasing system.

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:25.920
This shape will create six rings.

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:29.330
It'll create one ring per hour.

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:31.740
What happens when it's complete?

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:36.870
The core will release high density 
data to external networks.

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:39.080
What happens then?

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:43.080
Computers can't withstand 
this high density data.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:47.800
Records and programs connected 
to the network will vanish.

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:51.510
Power plants, hospitals, transportation…

00:06:52.100 --> 00:06:54.490
The world will be in a huge panic.

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:59.130
Humanity will revert to an era 
when there were no computers!

00:06:59.130 --> 00:07:03.190
But we're safe as long as we 
don’t connect to the net.

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:05.140
Maybe not.

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:11.160
If Revolver’s goal is to erase 
you, I'm sure he planned for that.

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:13.480
You’re right.

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:18.110
The high density data will take down 
major devices in a chain reaction.

00:07:18.110 --> 00:07:22.080
The resulting pulse will be 
magnified and transmitted.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:28.510
So devices not connected to the 
network will also be destroyed.

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:31.710
It’s like an EMP weapon.

00:07:31.710 --> 00:07:33.890
And you'll be erased.

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:40.130
He's threatening the whole world 
just to erase Ai.  He's crazy!

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:56.130
I’m Kitamura, the one in charge of LINK 
VRAINS’s security for SOL Technologies!

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:59.100
I want to speak to the 
Knights of Hanoi's leader!

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:11.800
I revealed my identity and came here alone!

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:15.050
I'm not here to negotiate!  Or trap you!

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:16.970
I just want to talk!

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:18.970
Please answer me!

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:24.860
Since I lost control of LINK 
VRAINS, I'll be demoted.

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:28.630
In that case, I'm disowning SOL Technologies!

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:32.650
I'll change this huge 
pinch into a huge chance!

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:33.660
What do you want?

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:40.540
Who are you?

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:44.000
I’m Revolver, leader 
of the Knights of Hanoi.

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:46.210
Revolver?

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:47.940
Now's my chance!

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:52.770
I’m Kitamura, SOL Technologies’ Security-

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:54.230
State your business.

00:08:54.230 --> 00:08:56.270
If it’s garbage, I’ll erase you.

00:08:56.270 --> 00:08:57.980
T-Take it easy.

00:08:57.980 --> 00:09:01.500
There’s no one in LINK 
VRAINS, except for us.

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:06.760
All news outlets have left, so 
no one is covering LINK VRAINS.

00:09:06.760 --> 00:09:08.030
So?

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:10.880
No one is listening to us.

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:14.370
So this will be a secret 
agreement just between us.

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:15.350
So?

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:18.130
I’ll get right to the point.

00:09:18.130 --> 00:09:21.250
Team up with me to rule LINK VRAINS.

00:09:22.920 --> 00:09:27.790
I realize that you’re in 
a superior position than me.

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:32.660
Because LINK VRAINS is 
currently in Hanoi’s hands.

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:35.570
But SOL Technologies won’t remain silent.

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:38.900
They'll do whatever it 
takes to regain control.

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:47.400
But if I'm on your side, since I manage 
LINK VRAINS, your rule will be absolute.

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:51.470
We can acquire a fortune if we work together.

00:09:51.470 --> 00:09:53.850
I see.  How interesting.

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:56.020
All right!

00:09:56.020 --> 00:10:00.990
But if you want to join us, 
we must test your abilities.

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:03.720
Handle this.

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:06.290
Hey!  Where are you going?

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:10.260
I’m honored to meet you.

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:13.990
Hello.  My name is Spectre.

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:15.960
Spectre?

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:19.610
I'll test your abilities.

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:21.210
In a Master Duel.

00:10:21.920 --> 00:10:23.440
Master Duel?

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:29.720
This area is in bad shape.

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:30.860
Yeah.

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:35.540
The danger is at max level.

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:38.500
The other news outlets have evacuated.

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:41.650
Then we should leave too!

00:10:41.650 --> 00:10:46.550
You fool!  This is when we must report 
what’s happening in LINK VRAINS!

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:49.290
That’s what makes us true journalists.

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:51.610
Really?  I didn’t know that!

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:58.820
I thought we did on-the-scene reports like lame 
tabloid shows, but we're actually true journalists!

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:04.450
That’s right!  Puff out your pigeon chest!

00:11:05.240 --> 00:11:09.990
And I'm sure our network won't tell 
us to stay in this dangerous place.

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:11.970
Hello?

00:11:12.510 --> 00:11:14.200
A message from the network.

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:17.710
Due to the success of your previous report...

00:11:17.710 --> 00:11:20.990
...we permit you to stay in 
LINK VRAINS to report the news.

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:22.470
What?

00:11:22.470 --> 00:11:24.360
What should we do?

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:29.070
Work hard and get a bonus 
to make up for last time!

00:11:29.070 --> 00:11:29.710
Okay!

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:32.980
Someone's there.

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:34.920
Start filming!

00:11:40.710 --> 00:11:43.520
Video of LINK VRAINS has been restored!

00:11:43.520 --> 00:11:45.030
Someone's dueling!

00:11:46.980 --> 00:11:51.450
Isn’t that Zaizen’s successor?  Kitamura?

00:11:51.450 --> 00:11:54.270
Yeah.  But who’s his opponent?

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:59.510
I don’t know.  But it has to be a Hanoi.

00:12:08.170 --> 00:12:12.930
Taking over LINK VRAINS was simple.

00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:16.890
Because someone as incompetent 
as you was managing it.

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:20.260
Thank you, Kitamura.

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:23.430
But you're despicable.

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:28.760
Watching you trying to manipulate 
Revolver was nauseating.

00:12:32.440 --> 00:12:34.340
C’mon, Spectre.

00:12:34.340 --> 00:12:38.030
I now know how capable you are.

00:12:38.030 --> 00:12:41.220
Please let me join the Hanoi.

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:43.140
Recruit me.

00:12:43.140 --> 00:12:47.620
As you wish, I’ll let you join the Hanoi.

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.410
Really?

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:52.330
But as data.

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:58.440
Stop!  Don’t do it!

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:04.240
You were garbage to the end.

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:05.370
Now then…

00:13:09.030 --> 00:13:10.440
This is a warning.

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:14.210
Those who enter LINK VRAINS 
will end up the same as him.

00:13:16.820 --> 00:13:21.180
But if you don’t care, feel free to come.

00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:23.620
Bye!

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:26.630
We got incredible footage!

00:13:26.630 --> 00:13:30.100
Yeah.  But what did he mean?

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:34.330
He means that he'll turn us into data.

00:13:35.260 --> 00:13:37.230
I don’t like that, Yamamoto-

00:13:37.230 --> 00:13:39.280
Don’t call me by my real name!

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:40.240
I’m sorry!

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:43.270
Stop shaking!

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:11.310
I won’t let the Hanoi 
do whatever they like.

00:14:11.310 --> 00:14:12.770
I’ll shut down that core.

00:14:12.770 --> 00:14:19.080
Since it absorbed the data material, there are no 
Data Storms in LINK VRAINS, except near the tower.

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:21.780
You can’t get there on your board.

00:14:21.780 --> 00:14:23.460
But I’m still going.

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:26.680
To end it with Revolver?

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:29.650
Yeah.  That's what he wants too.

00:14:30.790 --> 00:14:33.390
Deck set!

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:35.840
Into the VRAINS!

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:47.570
We won't get home alive.

00:14:48.730 --> 00:14:51.110
All that’s left is to die with honor.

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:54.180
Let's risk our lives to 
get our scoop!  And bonus!

00:15:09.520 --> 00:15:10.970
Playmaker!

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:14.860
Go Onizuka!

00:15:14.860 --> 00:15:16.060
Hey!  Over there!

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:21.370
So you came too.

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:23.280
Why are you here?

00:15:23.280 --> 00:15:25.380
That’s what I was going to say.

00:15:25.380 --> 00:15:27.380
Especially you, Blue Angel.

00:15:27.380 --> 00:15:31.850
I thought you only fought for yourself.

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:35.310
I learned something from my duels.

00:15:35.310 --> 00:15:40.790
When people believe in you, 
you’re fighting for everyone.

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:45.770
So Blue Angel fights for 
everyone from now on!

00:15:46.080 --> 00:15:47.660
I’m the same.

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:52.730
I’m LINK VRAINS’s hero, so it’s 
my mission to protect this place!

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:55.340
Always full of energy.

00:15:55.340 --> 00:15:58.110
So that’s Ignis, the special AI.

00:15:58.110 --> 00:16:01.070
I have a wonderful name, you know!  Ai!

00:16:01.070 --> 00:16:03.100
Call me Master Ai from now on!

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:04.460
Actually, Lord Ai!

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:06.110
No, Professor Ai!

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:06.980
No, Aiai!

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:09.620
Playmaker, why are you here?

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:10.720
Ignoring me?

00:16:11.120 --> 00:16:12.960
For three reasons.

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:16.690
#1: I'll stop the Tower of 
Hanoi that's causing this.

00:16:16.690 --> 00:16:21.580
#2: I'll rescue Ghost Girl, who 
gave me info about that tower.

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:27.640
And #3: I must end it with the 
person behind this incident.

00:16:28.300 --> 00:16:30.100
Something happened to Ghost Girl?

00:16:30.430 --> 00:16:35.190
Yeah.  Revolver, the Knights of 
Hanoi's leader, defeated her.

00:16:35.190 --> 00:16:38.710
She was turned into data 
and absorbed into the core.

00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:40.180
No way…

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:44.280
She gave you info about the tower?

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:45.520
What info?

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:51.260
Revolver will use that Tower of 
Hanoi to execute a terrifying plan.

00:16:51.260 --> 00:16:53.230
What plan?

00:16:53.230 --> 00:16:55.460
To destroy the entire network.

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:57.030
What?

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:58.430
That’s impossible.

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:06.640
He can.  When the Tower of Hanoi is 
complete, it will erase all information on the network.

00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:09.640
But if that happens...

00:17:09.640 --> 00:17:14.380
...won’t it erase the consciousnesses of 
Ghost Girl and everyone who were absorbed?

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:19.650
Exactly.  That’s why I must 
stop it before it activates.

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:21.490
And I don’t want to be erased either.

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:24.820
But how can it be stopped?

00:17:25.300 --> 00:17:27.060
By defeating Revolver.

00:17:28.300 --> 00:17:30.200
The time limit is six hours.

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:32.170
Six hours!

00:17:32.170 --> 00:17:35.910
Or the Tower of Hanoi will be completed.

00:17:37.140 --> 00:17:39.850
Revolver is waiting at the Tower of Hanoi.

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:43.350
And I will end it with him!

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:46.090
I’m going too!

00:17:46.090 --> 00:17:47.290
Me too!

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:50.090
No, go home.  It’s too dangerous.

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:52.050
I knew you'd say that.

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:55.520
After hearing all this, I can’t go home.

00:17:55.920 --> 00:18:01.260
It’s my duty to protect the 
children's futures, dreams and hopes!

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:03.100
I feel the same.

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:05.230
We must rescue Ghost Girl too!

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:07.460
Do whatever you want.

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:09.750
Belligerent as always.

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:13.590
Among us three, one of 
us must defeat Revolver!

00:18:14.680 --> 00:18:16.290
But be careful.

00:18:16.290 --> 00:18:21.180
According to Ghost Girl, 
Revolver has a terrifying card.

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:24.990
Let’s meet again if we’re still alive.

00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:26.460
Good luck.

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:27.190
See ya!

00:18:31.700 --> 00:18:33.500
This is a huge scoop!

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:39.870
Yeah.  LINK VRAINS' three heroes will 
fight the Knights of Hanoi's leader.

00:18:41.670 --> 00:18:45.020
What’s wrong?  Why are you in shock?

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:47.240
I forgot to film them!

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:48.310
What?

00:18:49.890 --> 00:18:51.900
Playmaker is gone too!

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:53.230
What?

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:56.220
Hurry up and find them!

00:19:03.340 --> 00:19:05.130
Stop hiding and come out!

00:19:05.130 --> 00:19:08.590
Oh, have my wishes come true?

00:19:11.490 --> 00:19:13.040
You were just on...

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:14.940
My name is Spectre.

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:18.730
This is the second time we meet, Blue Angel.

00:19:18.730 --> 00:19:19.610
Second time?

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:23.260
Let me open the door deep in your heart.

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:34.750
You implanted the computer virus in me!

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:36.690
It was a present.

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:38.960
Because I’m your fan.

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:42.340
Tell me why you’re doing this!

00:19:42.770 --> 00:19:44.510
There's no point telling you.

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:48.530
It’s like when hobbies and 
beliefs are incompatible.

00:19:48.530 --> 00:19:49.240
Hobbies?

00:19:49.240 --> 00:19:57.210
A lowly idol can’t understand the 
ideas of those with noble beliefs.

00:19:57.610 --> 00:19:59.180
Big talk.

00:19:59.180 --> 00:20:05.670
Revolver ordered me to annihilate 
everyone who invades this world.

00:20:05.670 --> 00:20:07.700
If you want to flee, now's the time.

00:20:07.700 --> 00:20:10.400
I’ll send those words back at you!

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:13.370
I'll defeat you!  And Revolver!

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:16.360
I can’t ignore what you said.

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:21.100
No matter how many weaklings arrive, 
you’re no match for Revolver.

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:24.030
Want to test that?

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:26.560
You don’t back down.

00:20:26.560 --> 00:20:30.510
Even though you know best what will happen.

00:20:30.510 --> 00:20:33.240
You’ll implant another computer virus?

00:20:33.240 --> 00:20:37.210
No.  It will be much worse.

00:20:38.260 --> 00:20:41.330
You'll never return to the real world again.

00:20:41.330 --> 00:20:42.800
Fine with that?

00:20:44.420 --> 00:20:50.770
Fine.  In order to protect LINK 
VRAINS, Blue Angel will defeat you!

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:53.370
You're making me shiver.

00:20:53.370 --> 00:20:55.130
Let’s have a Master Duel.

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:57.100
Fine.  Let’s go!

00:20:57.100 --> 00:20:59.350
I’m looking forward to this.

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:02.900
Duel!

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:09.020
I shall go first.  It's my turn!

00:21:09.020 --> 00:21:12.480
I summon Sunseed Genius Loci from my hand!

00:21:17.220 --> 00:21:20.700
Appear!  The future circuit 
that lights up our path!

00:21:21.260 --> 00:21:22.790
Link Summon already?

00:21:24.320 --> 00:21:26.100
Arrowheads confirmed!

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:30.570
The summoning condition is one Plant monster!

00:21:30.570 --> 00:21:35.120
I set Sunseed Genius Loci in the Link Marker!

00:21:39.800 --> 00:21:41.760
Circuit combine!

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:43.370
Link Summon!

00:21:43.370 --> 00:21:47.780
Appear, Link 1 Sunavalon Dryas!

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:15.740
My life is like detestably bad graffiti

00:22:16.130 --> 00:22:22.880
But when you looked at 
me, I felt I wasn't alone

00:22:23.300 --> 00:22:30.110
I'm glad that I'm alive  I truly am

00:22:30.610 --> 00:22:37.460
What I couldn't say before, I can say now

00:22:38.310 --> 00:22:44.700
Within the sadness that I kept holding down

00:22:45.080 --> 00:22:48.850
There were fragments of power

00:22:49.080 --> 00:22:56.030
No one can take away my light to the future

00:22:56.260 --> 00:23:03.370
The chronicles of life only has a few lines

00:23:03.500 --> 00:23:10.550
People I meet, my regrets – they're 
all like ultramarine diamonds to me

00:23:10.800 --> 00:23:17.780
You've always confront loneliness by yourself

00:23:17.910 --> 00:23:24.630
I bet we can now laugh 
together, forever and ever

00:23:25.350 --> 00:23:32.330
Lighting Life with our invisible bond

00:23:36.460 --> 00:23:41.500
A girl was captivated by a picture 
book that was read to her.

00:23:41.500 --> 00:23:45.820
Acting tough, she wants to be 
alone.  But she's crying inside.

00:23:45.820 --> 00:23:51.580
But the hero helps her be courageous 
and accept herself for the first time.

00:23:51.580 --> 00:23:55.420
The name of the book is... Blue Angel!

00:23:55.420 --> 00:23:59.370
Five and a half hours until the 
Tower of Hanoi is complete.

00:23:59.370 --> 00:24:03.170
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Angel With Blue Tears

00:24:03.170 --> 00:24:05.320
Into the VRAINS!
